.submit-btn"\par ├─ ".primary-button"\par └─ ".btn-submit"\par \par ```\par \par ### **3. AI-Enhanced Healing**\par \par ```\par \par AI Analysis Request to GPT-4o:\par "Find submit button on page with HTML: <html>...</html>"\par \par AI Response:\par "Try xpath: //button[contains(@class, &#x27;primary&#x27;) and contains(text(), &#x27;Submit&#x27;)]"\par \par Test Result: ✅ Element found and clicked successfully\par \par ```\par \par ### **4. Learning & Optimization**\par \par ```\par \par Successful Pattern Stored:\par ├─ Original locator: By.ID, "submit-btn"\par ├─ Working fallback: By.XPATH, "//button[contains(text(), &#x27;Submit&#x27;)]"\par ├─ Page context: Shopping cart page\par └─ Success rate: 95%\par \par Future Use: Prioritize successful patterns first\par \par ```\par \par ## 🛒 Real-World Example: Shopping Cart Test\par \par ### **Test Scenario**\par \par 1. <strong>Search for product</strong>: "Robot Framework Book"\par \par 2. <strong>Add item to cart</strong>: Click "Add to Cart" button\par \par 3. <strong>Verify success</strong>: Check for confirmation message\par \par ### **Traditional vs Self-Healing Approach**\par \par <strong>Traditional Test (Brittle):</strong>\par \par ```\par \par Click Element    id=add-to-cart-btn\par # Fails when developer changes ID to "add-cart-button"\par \par ```\par \par <strong>Self-Healing Test (Resilient):</strong>\par \par ```\par \par Heal And Click Element    add to cart button\par ...    id=add-to-cart-btn\par ...    id=add-cart-button\par ...    css=.add-cart-btn\par ...    xpath=//button[contains(text(),&#x27;Add to Cart&#x27;)]\par # Automatically tries alternatives until one works\par \par ```\par \par ## 🤖 AI Integration with Walmart Infrastructure\par \par ### **Corporate AI Gateway Integration**\par \par - <strong>Endpoint</strong>: Walmart LLM Gateway (GPT-4o)\par \par - <strong>Authentication</strong>: JWT Bearer tokens\par \par - <strong>Model</strong>: GPT-4o optimized for element detection\par \par 